Package: pocketpsp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, make
Recommends: ppsspp
Description: Write Sony PSP homebrew games in a restricted Python DSL
 pocketpsp checks a restricted subset of Python, generates C code, builds it
 with the PSP SDK (pspdev, installed separately) and can launch the result in
 PPSSPP.
